#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Take a 20-question exam to test your quantum chemistry skills and receive a "
"badge from the IBM Training website."
msgstr ""
"Beantworte 20 Fragen, um dein Wissen über Quantenchemie zu testen, und "
"erhalte ein Badge von der IBM Training-Website."

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
